{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "2655043114a29e46fe25a9b927a09d633d18da58092d899a9914c112c13888f6", "ja": "ドラマの役作り", "zh": "戏剧的角色塑造", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4000_place", "source_sha256": "45a2639bee133f79fa257c83a1284145a61c3e0a2c5692309a6e2fb52ad44dc9", "ja": "レッスンスタジオ", "zh": "排练教室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4001_p", "source_sha256": "fe43249d76e146a476434e4ae62baa31ee349e8453ef3cf9227405c63ad73b29", "ja": "翼、今度受けるオーディションの役作りは、\n進んでるか？　原作小説を渡したと思うけど……。", "zh": "翼，这次试镜的角色塑造进行得顺利吗？\n我应该有把原著小说交给你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "be3a31cb3e195b1f180cc8af8bb364bd8db7c6996ce0d96363f704b840512ded", "ja": "それ……長いし、字ばっかりなんですよ～？\nそれに読んでると、眠くなってきちゃって……。", "zh": "那个……好长，内容还全都是字耶～\n而且我一开始看书，就想睡觉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4003_p", "source_sha256": "a3ba340ac4ffcda9fd629811f28c7af6c8fda32f0d7e889f9fb80540f23dca1a", "ja": "小説なんだから、当たり前だろ……。いいか？\n役作りのためにも、ちゃんと最後まで読んでおくこと。", "zh": "那是小说，当然都是字啊……听好了，\n为了塑造角色，你得好好把书给看完。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0ad7548836e2c60fc145403c79c5ebcb1cf2b0e2f48f9f5e7656963ca349f3c6", "ja": "え～！？　……あ、そうだ！\n{$P$}さんは、読んだんですよね？", "zh": "咦～！？……啊，对了！\n{$P$}先生已经看过书了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4d5328deca4dce28473a0f8ea73eb9882fbbc763408152249e1ab7323a13cbbb", "ja": "だったら、{$P$}さんがわたしに、\nあらすじ教えて～！", "zh": "既然这样，就由{$P$}先生\n把故事的大纲告诉我吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "76d7edc87f7e125d86fe4eca884ecb7893af2c5f09f63dfa40e51e1f88adf038", "ja": "内容がわかったら、読めるかもしれないし……ねっ？\nそう思いません？", "zh": "只要先知道内容，说不定就看得下去了……如何？\n你不这么认为吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4007_p", "source_sha256": "d93e11092a8544548dcdf2c09f74620a8521074c16b69acd2fe87f7687343bcd", "ja": "（う～ん。確かに、あらすじがわかっていた方が、\n小説も読み進めやすいかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（唔～的确，知道故事大纲的话，\n或许小说会比较容易看得下去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4008", "source_sha256": "7e9fd82b17c5f9ba2188b70b624b7cb5baa43315fd242df46420110d402c0ff1", "ja": "ヒロインは\nモテモテだぞ！", "zh": "女主角\n很受欢迎喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4009", "source_sha256": "e60713153363d51c883bcfd51637708be0f04f851030532b2b39ea25496eb875", "ja": "原作は、台本と\nストーリーが違う！", "zh": "原著和剧本\n的故事不一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4010", "source_sha256": "1d7a0a920c9e08e38b772987ce5e6da50039cf2b423607eefb08771ac59794de", "ja": "犯人はコイツだ！", "zh": "犯人是这家伙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4100_p", "source_sha256": "393fb5acaed81b901e20ab2886663adf48ea041585aad22457ef9d3dfff5f8b7", "ja": "翼……この本のヒロインは、モテモテだぞ！", "zh": "翼……这本书的女主角很受欢迎喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4101_016tsu", "source_sha256": "26127f2bd0516c6f77a8b968c3e6b22d9b94312cfe43870ca20f18720ec7281a", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうなの？", "zh": "咦咦！？是、是这样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4102_p", "source_sha256": "e2e7a484c6b265639f3c3b1a88f34e58ace4467bb652b5f99829951f0b7d16c4", "ja": "ああ。彼女がどうやって、オシャレでハッピーな生活と\n10人の求婚者を手に入れたか……知りたくないか？", "zh": "是啊。她是怎么让自己过上时尚又愉快的生活，\n而且还吸引到十名求婚者……你不想知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4103_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b7ea6bf35be1444c43f830f1724d735a61df038733e1ba3a2436f4f105c660a4", "ja": "知りたい！　すっごく知りたい！\nそれってわたしの夢に、超役に立つかも～♪", "zh": "我想知道！超级想知道！\n那个对实现我的梦想说不定超有帮助呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4104_p", "source_sha256": "c602e826f27c5fe2abb8bc93e68489cadd68bb0cab333e8567fd9979a10a3616", "ja": "（翼はあっという間に原作を読み切り……\n見事、オーディションでヒロイン役を射止めた！）", "zh": "（翼转眼间就把原著读完……\n然后顺利在试镜中拿下女主角的角色！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4200_p", "source_sha256": "15eb34d9eb60eab54517ae5952f9bade3fa6dc3648881798a9b189056fba8fdd", "ja": "実はな……原作は、ドラマの台本とは\nかなりストーリーが違うんだ。", "zh": "其实……原著和戏剧剧本的故事\n差得满多的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4201_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2c20d8a9ca6c3f062c4f629a215e6b243a94336330763884ead003e86e2549d1", "ja": "えっ！！　そうなの！？", "zh": "咦！！是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4202_p", "source_sha256": "7b316aac41a165f8ee816708bd807998d92fd7c2784cda46971dcce161d576ed", "ja": "ああ。だから、ドラマでは描かれない部分の\n心情を理解するためにも……。", "zh": "是啊。所以，为了理解剧情中\n未描写出来的心理层面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4203_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9db990609c0ff4d5b18f1c03d28045c18cd7c5314a657d40e9c0712df43ce2f1", "ja": "な～んだ、じゃあ原作を読む必要ないですね！\n台本を読めば、全部わかるんだもん♪　よかった～。", "zh": "什么嘛～那就不需要读原著了吧！\n只要看过剧本就能全部明白了嘛♪太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4204_p", "source_sha256": "cf54b7b30d2195fe120e975994347ff66bca9efc83048042a4afcfc675f10bf6", "ja": "そ、それは違うぞ、翼！\n……しまった、逆効果だったか……。", "zh": "可、可不是那样啊，翼！\n……糟糕，造成反效果了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4300_p", "source_sha256": "ffdc7eff67e5eb56fd1460cfe4c5a7f85937b3f5ed2c0a07692e137d57b10299", "ja": "実は、この物語には黒幕がいてな。\nすべての事件を起こした真犯人……それはコイツだ！", "zh": "其实，这故事暗藏了黑幕，\n引发所有事件的真犯人……就是这家伙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4301_016tsu", "source_sha256": "00067de56e20fcb90bbea12dd1e1cbecb68bb166cf2272b0b558182db5fb8618", "ja": "ええっ！？　……って、あれ～？\nこの本、恋愛モノって聞いた気がするんですけど……。", "zh": "什么！？……欸，奇怪～？\n我好像听说过这本书是本爱情小说啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4302_016tsu", "source_sha256": "32087b474e0914d682fb0ab8b19a3c6e83e79a5008ffa031d36c4e363eeb191a", "ja": "も～！　わたしは真剣に聞いてるのに～！\n{$P$}さん、マジメにやって～！", "zh": "讨厌～！我是认真在问你的耶～！\n{$P$}先生，你认真点啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_4303_p", "source_sha256": "aaf05c5eb95400660c1de29d9bfde4ac5fb7733f459ecd8ddaa03b8792043165", "ja": "ご、ごめん……って、あれ？　\nどうして俺が怒られてるんだ……？", "zh": "抱、抱歉……奇怪？\n为什么我会被骂……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
